OL,3,GNEWSAFamily race to save boy with
OL,4,Aultra-rare condition
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen six-year-old Partaap began
OL,7,Fstruggling to stand, climb the stairs
OL,8,Fand do other everyday activities, his
OL,9,Fparents knew something was wrong.
OL,11,FOver the following months, his family
OL,12,Ffaced a series of hospital appointments
OL,13,Fand tests as they searched for answers.
OL,15,FThe diagnosis, when it came, was
OL,16,Fdevastating.
OL,18,FDoctors told them Partaap had an
OL,19,Fextremely rare variant of Juvenile ALS,
OL,20,Fa type of motor neurone disease (MND),
OL,21,Faccording to the NHS.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
